  "headline": "Listyo Sigit and Ahrie Sonta to Testify in Alleged Treason Case",
  "seoTitle": "Listyo Sigit and Ahrie Sonta Treason Investigation",
  "metaDescription": "Former police chief Listyo Sigit and Irjen Ahrie Sonta are set to testify in a treason case stemming from illegal wiretapping investigations.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Former police chief Listyo Sigit and Irjen Ahrie Sonta will provide testimony in an ongoing investigation concerning alleged treason.",
    "The treason inquiry developed from a broader investigation into illegal wiretapping incidents involving President Prabowo Subianto.",
    "Four suspects linked to the initial wiretapping case are also expected to serve as witnesses in the current treason proceedings."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police’s Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim Polri) is currently expanding its inquiry into alleged treason, a development that originated from a high-profile case involving illegal wiretapping targeting President Prabowo Subianto. As the investigation progresses, authorities have confirmed that former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit and Irjen Ahrie Sonta are expected to testify. The ongoing legal process has involved the examination of 59 witnesses by Bareskrim Polri. Furthermore, four suspects previously implicated in the illegal surveillance of the President will also participate as witnesses in this treason case. Recent reports indicate that while the police previously postponed an scheduled case exposure with the Attorney General's Office, the inquiry remains active, with investigators actively monitoring social media and other digital channels as they look deeper into the allegations against the individuals involved.",
